  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The proposed vehicle access and hard standing, by reason\r\nof its siting and loss of grass verge, would be an incongruous&amp;nbsp;and unduly obtrusive feature within the street scene and would be detrimental to\r\nthe character and appearance of the area. As such, the works would fail to accord with the high quality design\r\naspirations of National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policy D3.D(1) and\r\n(11) of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1B of The Harrow Core Strategy\r\n(2012), Policy DM1 of Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013)\r\nand the adopted Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
